<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Purpleroc的札记</title><link>https://wxrss.reinject.top/247c7f0331d700a674d37c6d757c3bbb/</link><description>An RSS feed.</description><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 05:22:18 +0800</lastBuildDate><generator>wxrss -- https://github.com/0xlane/wxrss</generator><item><title>LLM 代码审计走到哪一步了？40 篇论文、40 个开源项目和 175 份行业材料后的答案</title><link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODY2MDAzMQ==&amp;mid=2247485270&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=f07a455f843fd39bc474a0743d096406&amp;chksm=a7960fe0a5c862e92ba7386c1aca8775185fbf8a34ba735b1bd421601262b80f50de5d9982ac&amp;scene=0&amp;xtrack=1#rd</link><description><![CDATA[摘要：纯 Prompt、RAG、Agent、CPG、CodeQL、Skills、MCP、PoC……LLM 代码审计的技术路线越来越多，但真实能力究竟到了哪一步？本文结合公开论文、评测集、开源项目与国]]></description><author>Purpleroc的札记</author><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 15:29:38 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>LLM 代码审计方法论：反思、反驳与重构</title><link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODY2MDAzMQ==&amp;mid=2247485270&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=2269f070116ef68a28c69f54d476500b&amp;chksm=a7da1a041c8f2d77245bbd39627f46126bcc39a51f97710fde7ae12bad957fe8d093a855bffc&amp;scene=0&amp;xtrack=1#rd</link><description><![CDATA[本文为Codex + GPT5.6 Sol对现有已收集文章总结出来的方法论的逐步反思、反驳和重构过程。看着有点引人反思～希望对你有用0. 结论先行现有调研的主要方向没有错：纯 LLM 裸扫整仓不可靠]]></description><author>Purpleroc的札记</author><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 15:29:38 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>LLM 代码审计：评测集与实验矩阵</title><link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODY2MDAzMQ==&amp;mid=2247485270&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=e97e03322554d4d077b298dbd57a3ceb&amp;chksm=a7fdc8588ffc2d794b403d4e869e4a095b9fd710afe95b1071168971aa51cfe45561dd86f865&amp;scene=0&amp;xtrack=1#rd</link><description><![CDATA[核心原则：函数二分类、语句定位、仓库级审计、漏洞验证和补丁修复是不同任务，分数不能横向混用。本文为Codex自动整理生成，希望对你有启发～1. 关键评测集评测集年份对象/粒度规模与覆盖典型验证优点主]]></description><author>Purpleroc的札记</author><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 15:29:38 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>成熟的AI该学会自己赚会员费了：一下午，它帮我薅了1000刀奖金</title><link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=M